    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Momentum Mayhem, a simple 2.5D physics based puzzle game. Filled with over 100 levels and over 30 unique items, you can choose to solve the puzzles casually - or find a way to cheese it. It's just plain physics after all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/408372e9607f32736a073c50dbd262bc.poster.avif?t=1721366791\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/408372e9607f32736a073c50dbd262bc.webm?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/408372e9607f32736a073c50dbd262bc.mp4?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>39 items with unique properties. Break glass panels directly with force or shatter them with a nearby explosion! Use mechanical belts to relay rotation or use it as a conveyor belt to transport items. Use a mechanical motor to convert electrical energy to rotational energy or feed it rotational energy to convert it to electrical energy. There are some interesting combinations to be found.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/60e08890f105f39013efca1d26fd0f79.poster.avif?t=1721366791\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/60e08890f105f39013efca1d26fd0f79.webm?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/60e08890f105f39013efca1d26fd0f79.mp4?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Momentum Mayhem, a simple 2.5D physics based puzzle game. Filled with over 100 levels and over 30 unique items, you can choose to solve the puzzles casually - or find a way to cheese it. It's just plain physics after all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/408372e9607f32736a073c50dbd262bc.poster.avif?t=1721366791\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/408372e9607f32736a073c50dbd262bc.webm?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/408372e9607f32736a073c50dbd262bc.mp4?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>39 items with unique properties. Break glass panels directly with force or shatter them with a nearby explosion! Use mechanical belts to relay rotation or use it as a conveyor belt to transport items. Use a mechanical motor to convert electrical energy to rotational energy or feed it rotational energy to convert it to electrical energy. There are some interesting combinations to be found.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/60e08890f105f39013efca1d26fd0f79.poster.avif?t=1721366791\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/60e08890f105f39013efca1d26fd0f79.webm?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051110/extras/60e08890f105f39013efca1d26fd0f79.mp4?t=1721366791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
